1
00:01:51,675 --> 00:01:53,675


2
00:01:53,699 --> 00:01:58,013
Now, everyone, here is part two of "The Return of the Great Witch."

3
00:02:01,249 --> 00:02:05,091
Sapphire, turned into a doll by the magic of Hecate's mother, Madam Hell,

4
00:02:05,115 --> 00:02:08,360
falls under Madam Hell's spell and heads toward Demon's Cave.

5
00:02:08,945 --> 00:02:11,491
Meanwhile, Hecate, wanting no part in becoming a grand witch,

6
00:02:11,515 --> 00:02:13,600
disguises herself as a kitten and runs away from home.

7
00:02:14,320 --> 00:02:18,017
She then finds the doll-ified Sapphire and helps her escape to Goldland,

8
00:02:18,042 --> 00:02:20,800
home of Sapphire's dear friend, Prince Franz.

9
00:02:21,734 --> 00:02:25,678
Prince Franz realizes that the flaxen-haired maiden he loved

10
00:02:25,703 --> 00:02:31,560


11
00:02:32,700 --> 00:02:36,105
However, Madame Hell's dark forces attack Goldland Castle,

12
00:02:36,129 --> 00:02:39,386
turning everyone inside into stone.

13
00:02:40,090 --> 00:02:43,100
Franz fights Mephisto with all his remaining strength.

14
00:02:43,600 --> 00:02:47,760
Exhausted, he is helpless as Sapphire is carried off by the demon.

15
00:02:48,790 --> 00:02:50,180
Sapphire!

16
00:03:04,760 --> 00:03:05,238
Franz...

17
00:03:05,835 --> 00:03:06,959
Poor Franz...

18
00:03:10,840 --> 00:03:11,371
Franz!

19
00:03:11,729 --> 00:03:13,786
Please don't be so sad, Franz!

20
00:03:17,240 --> 00:03:19,140
Little kitten... can you speak?

21
00:03:19,700 --> 00:03:24,480
You don't even cover your eyes... Mysterious kitten, do you understand my grief?

22
00:03:24,765 --> 00:03:25,780
Yes, I do.

23
00:03:27,060 --> 00:03:30,986
Even if you're a magical cat, you don't have the power to save my Sapphire!

24
00:03:31,750 --> 00:03:34,526
Sapphire! Sapphire!

25
00:03:36,960 --> 00:03:38,640
Sapphire!

26
00:03:40,210 --> 00:03:42,426
You demons, give Sapphire back!

27
00:03:42,480 --> 00:03:44,980
Prince Franz, don't give up. Please.

28
00:03:45,053 --> 00:03:46,266
Show yourselves, demons!

29
00:03:47,040 --> 00:03:49,500
Prince Franz, I know where Sapphire is.

30
00:03:49,844 --> 00:03:51,693
What? Where Sapphire is?

31
00:03:53,540 --> 00:03:54,820
Tell me, where is she?

32
00:03:55,400 --> 00:03:56,328
W-Well...

33
00:03:56,352 --> 00:03:57,580
Tell me, hurry!

34
00:03:57,650 --> 00:03:58,890
W-Wait a minute!

35
00:04:02,120 --> 00:04:03,168
Oh, what should I do?

36
00:04:03,192 --> 00:04:06,460
Mama and Papa must have taken Sapphire back to the cave.

37
00:04:07,230 --> 00:04:10,080
If I take Franz there, what will Mama and Papa say?

38
00:04:10,640 --> 00:04:14,474
I don't care if I get scolded, but if something awful happens to Franz...

39
00:04:16,212 --> 00:04:19,959
I couldn't bear it if something terrible happened to wonderful Franz!

40
00:04:21,359 --> 00:04:22,833
Little kitten, aren't you done yet?

41
00:04:23,295 --> 00:04:25,480
Well? Did you figure it out? Which way is it?

42
00:04:26,360 --> 00:04:27,620
Um, over there!

43
00:04:35,320 --> 00:04:36,980
Sapphire, I'm coming!

44
00:04:37,615 --> 00:04:39,560
Oh no, what am I going to do?

45
00:05:02,610 --> 00:05:05,099
Franz, Franz, come save me...

46
00:05:07,975 --> 00:05:10,940
How frustrating! Where on earth is that idiot Hecate loitering?

47
00:05:11,265 --> 00:05:13,660
Why not search with the demon orb, Mama?

48
00:05:14,454 --> 00:05:15,540
I already know that.

49
00:05:15,885 --> 00:05:16,894
Honestly, dear,

50
00:05:16,918 --> 00:05:20,093
taking off to play without even asking Hecate's parents—

51
00:05:20,118 --> 00:05:21,166
what on earth were you thinking?

52
00:05:21,415 --> 00:05:23,060
It's because you haven't disciplined her properly!

53
00:05:23,415 --> 00:05:25,313
Come on, don't nag me, Mama.

54
00:05:25,640 --> 00:05:29,400
Maybe even Hecate is too scared of those gods to come back.

55
00:05:29,424 --> 00:05:30,006
You!

56
00:05:31,676 --> 00:05:33,820
Isn't your demon's crystal ball cloudy?

57
00:05:37,510 --> 00:05:39,280
The Demon's orb is the Demon's soul!

58
00:05:39,380 --> 00:05:40,987
It's tarnished and you haven't even polished it! 

59
00:05:41,012 --> 00:05:41,920
What is the meaning of this?!

60
00:05:47,870 --> 00:05:48,574
Damn it.

61
00:05:48,598 --> 00:05:52,640
Every year around Christmas, demons bring nothing but trouble.

62
00:05:52,740 --> 00:05:54,420
Stop complaining and keep polishing!

63
00:05:55,180 --> 00:05:57,514
There's no way Franz knows about this place.

64
00:05:57,539 --> 00:05:59,981
Right, as soon as Hecate gets back,

65
00:06:00,005 --> 00:06:02,640
she'll be forced to have the heart-swap surgery immediately.

66
00:06:03,640 --> 00:06:06,460
I have to escape before Hecate gets back.

67
00:06:25,060 --> 00:06:26,460
Where on earth is Sapphire?

68
00:06:26,535 --> 00:06:28,480
It feels like we're going in circles.

69
00:06:28,635 --> 00:06:31,180
Kitten, do you really know where she is?

70
00:06:31,573 --> 00:06:32,500
I do.

71
00:06:32,600 --> 00:06:34,313
Then where is she?

72
00:06:36,299 --> 00:06:37,000
Over there.

73
00:06:37,455 --> 00:06:38,361
What, that house?

74
00:06:38,512 --> 00:06:40,460
Is Sapphire trapped in there?

75
00:06:48,700 --> 00:06:49,501
Sapphire!

76
00:06:50,352 --> 00:06:51,260
Where are you, Sapphire?

77
00:06:51,695 --> 00:06:53,073
It's me! Franz!

78
00:06:56,750 --> 00:06:58,420
I see, the demon caught her so she can't answer!

79
00:06:58,620 --> 00:06:59,426
Alright!

80
00:07:04,900 --> 00:07:06,260
I'm sorry, Prince Franz.

81
00:07:07,360 --> 00:07:08,493
Not here... anywhere.

82
00:07:09,830 --> 00:07:11,640
Damn it, that kitten tricked me!

83
00:07:17,651 --> 00:07:21,753
No, that's not true! Franz, how could you say I tricked you?

84
00:07:21,965 --> 00:07:26,206
I... I just felt so sorry for you.

85
00:07:26,400 --> 00:07:27,980
That's why... That's why...

86
00:07:28,140 --> 00:07:31,826
Come out, kitten! So you were a minion of the demon, too.

87
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:33,673
No, it's not! No, it's not!

88
00:07:34,380 --> 00:07:37,280
You devils! You're hiding in the shadows, laughing at me, aren't you?!

89
00:07:37,560 --> 00:07:39,100
Come on, get out here!

90
00:07:39,480 --> 00:07:41,353
Then take my life!

91
00:07:41,690 --> 00:07:42,393
That's it!

92
00:07:43,040 --> 00:07:44,940
Barasha!

93
00:07:50,800 --> 00:07:52,500
Come out, you cowardly fiends!

94
00:07:52,875 --> 00:07:54,400
Franz! Franz!

95
00:07:56,666 --> 00:07:57,460
Sapphire!

96
00:07:57,715 --> 00:07:59,460
Yes, I saw my chance and escaped!

97
00:08:02,605 --> 00:08:05,220
Sapphire! My Sapphire!

98
00:08:07,530 --> 00:08:09,140
I'm deceiving this person.

99
00:08:10,250 --> 00:08:12,760
But I'm happy as long as I can stay like this.

100
00:08:15,415 --> 00:08:17,701
What's wrong, Sapphire? You look so sad...

101
00:08:18,900 --> 00:08:19,900
Sapphire!

102
00:08:22,113 --> 00:08:23,560
Sapphire, wait!

103
00:08:27,900 --> 00:08:28,900
What's wrong, Sapphire?

104
00:08:29,400 --> 00:08:33,393
I'm sorry, I'm sorry. I... I'm not Sapphire.

105
00:08:33,600 --> 00:08:34,353
What?

106
00:08:34,735 --> 00:08:36,153
I... I...

107
00:08:40,879 --> 00:08:44,080
I am Hecate, the demon's daughter. I was the kitten, too.

108
00:08:44,514 --> 00:08:47,399
A demon's daughter? Why on earth would a demon's daughter...?

109
00:08:47,803 --> 00:08:51,753
You were so heartbroken that I took Sapphire's form to comfort you...

110
00:08:51,778 --> 00:08:53,439
Please forgive me, Lord Franz.

111
00:08:55,289 --> 00:08:56,134
Forgive you?!

112
00:08:56,158 --> 00:08:57,688
 How could I ever forgive this?!

113
00:08:57,712 --> 00:08:59,528
You were making a fool of me!

114
00:08:59,552 --> 00:09:01,281
You were laughing at me, demon!

115
00:09:01,305 --> 00:09:03,240
Only a demon could do something so cruel!

116
00:09:04,430 --> 00:09:07,560
Why... why was I born as the child of a demon?

117
00:09:17,599 --> 00:09:19,491
Good grief, she finally finished polishing it.

118
00:09:19,515 --> 00:09:21,386
Mama! Mama, look at this!

119
00:09:22,420 --> 00:09:23,420
Show me?

120
00:09:26,489 --> 00:09:27,660
Sapphire escaped!

121
00:09:28,420 --> 00:09:29,420
That's impossible!

122
00:09:31,400 --> 00:09:32,400
Oh, damn it!

123
00:09:32,995 --> 00:09:35,960
She got away while I was distracted polishing the orb!

124
00:09:36,230 --> 00:09:37,600
Ah, you useless demon...!

125
00:09:39,234 --> 00:09:40,234
Almost there!

126
00:09:45,439 --> 00:09:46,520
You won't get away!

127
00:09:47,919 --> 00:09:52,000
That's right, don't give me any more trouble.

128
00:09:58,739 --> 00:10:01,840
I'm not like the good-for-nothings at my place.

129
00:10:12,844 --> 00:10:14,257
Zubarasha!

130
00:10:15,419 --> 00:10:16,600
You can't run anymore.

131
00:10:17,460 --> 00:10:20,420
Damn it! Let go! Let go!

132
00:10:20,866 --> 00:10:22,360
Struggling is useless!

133
00:10:28,593 --> 00:10:30,740
It got dirty again...

134
00:10:38,569 --> 00:10:39,540
Hecate,

135
00:10:39,977 --> 00:10:41,053
I'm sorry about earlier.

136
00:10:41,144 --> 00:10:44,560
Thinking about it, you were trying to help us, weren't you?

137
00:10:45,319 --> 00:10:48,166
Did you disguise yourself as Sapphire for my sake, too?

138
00:10:49,129 --> 00:10:52,280
Prince Franz, there is only one way to save Sapphire.

139
00:10:53,393 --> 00:10:54,020
Really?

140
00:10:54,609 --> 00:10:56,853
My parents are the ones who kidnapped Sapphire.

141
00:10:57,317 --> 00:11:00,180
So she must be locked up at my house.

142
00:11:00,545 --> 00:11:02,466
Where? Where is your house?

143
00:11:02,680 --> 00:11:03,740
Please wait.

144
00:11:03,764 --> 00:11:07,606
No matter how strong you are, you're no match for Mama and Papa. But...

145
00:11:07,630 --> 00:11:08,460
But?

146
00:11:09,100 --> 00:11:11,313
If Mama and Papa went blind...

147
00:11:11,338 --> 00:11:12,160
What?

148
00:11:12,184 --> 00:11:13,520
Blind your parents?

149
00:11:13,925 --> 00:11:15,960
Don't worry, it can be cured right away.

150
00:11:16,115 --> 00:11:18,266
They say if you drink sap from the Demon's Tree

151
00:11:18,291 --> 00:11:20,780
at the peak of Mount Harz, you go blind.

152
00:11:21,055 --> 00:11:22,299
The cursed Mount Harz...

153
00:11:41,660 --> 00:11:43,120
What's wrong, Hecate?

154
00:11:44,513 --> 00:11:45,780
Zubarasha!

155
00:11:48,324 --> 00:11:49,651
Yaaahhh!

156
00:11:53,699 --> 00:11:55,020
What on earth is going on here?

157
00:11:56,959 --> 00:12:00,139
Papa and Mama are using the Demon Orb to look for me,

158
00:12:00,164 --> 00:12:02,020
so I made a fake me.

159
00:12:02,514 --> 00:12:05,200
Now, fake me, go for a walk and sing a song.

160
00:12:07,020 --> 00:12:12,140
♪ Atashi no sukina oji sama ♪
My beloved prince...

161
00:12:17,319 --> 00:12:18,346
Good grief...

162
00:12:19,910 --> 00:12:20,774
Hecate!

163
00:12:20,984 --> 00:12:23,920
Mama! Mama! I found Hecate!

164
00:12:26,209 --> 00:12:27,493
Hecate's been found!

165
00:12:28,395 --> 00:12:29,620
This is finally it!

166
00:12:30,320 --> 00:12:32,140
She's at the foot of Mount Harz, isn't she?

167
00:12:32,780 --> 00:12:34,940
Now don't just stand there, hurry up and fly!

168
00:12:35,685 --> 00:12:37,840
Alright, alright, I'm off!

169
00:12:39,930 --> 00:12:43,040
Got it? Grab Hecate by the scruff of her neck!

170
00:12:43,145 --> 00:12:46,040
Oh my, what terrible language for someone like me!

171
00:12:56,814 --> 00:13:01,913
♪ Atashi no sukina oji sama ♪
My beloved prince...

172
00:13:02,020 --> 00:13:04,300
♪ La la la la la ♪
.

173
00:13:07,989 --> 00:13:11,629
Hecate, what were you doing? Mama is furious.

174
00:13:11,813 --> 00:13:12,820
Hey, Hecate!

175
00:13:15,536 --> 00:13:16,726
Cloning spell!

176
00:13:17,459 --> 00:13:20,300
Hecate, what on earth are you doing?! Cut it out!

177
00:13:33,766 --> 00:13:35,035
So that's the Demon's Tree.

178
00:13:35,059 --> 00:13:38,194
Mama said anyone who touches it gets cursed

179
00:13:38,219 --> 00:13:40,282
by the Great Demon King of Hell...

180
00:13:41,259 --> 00:13:42,819
But... but this is the only way...

181
00:13:45,319 --> 00:13:47,820
Prince Franz, wait here. I'll go alone.

182
00:13:48,065 --> 00:13:49,580
Hecate, be careful!

183
00:13:53,300 --> 00:13:54,240
Ono yo!

184
00:14:31,879 --> 00:14:34,080
Hecate, it's dangerous! Come back!

185
00:14:36,559 --> 00:14:39,866
The Great Demon King is angry. But no matter what happens to me...

186
00:14:48,113 --> 00:14:48,946
Hecate!

187
00:14:49,039 --> 00:14:51,460
Come back! Don't go!

188
00:14:51,507 --> 00:14:52,474
Hecate!

189
00:14:52,574 --> 00:14:54,009
Hecate!

190
00:15:20,160 --> 00:15:21,160
Oh, Hecate!

191
00:15:21,580 --> 00:15:25,080
Now we can save Sapphire! Let's get out of here quickly!

192
00:15:40,326 --> 00:15:41,823
it hurts...

193
00:15:41,854 --> 00:15:43,006
Hecate, what's wrong?

194
00:15:43,480 --> 00:15:45,706
D-Don't come near me!

195
00:15:49,369 --> 00:15:51,720
The demon's tree is cursed!

196
00:15:53,189 --> 00:15:56,226
What? You went near that tree knowing that?

197
00:15:56,600 --> 00:16:00,917
Never mind me! If Papa or Mama find you, we won't be able to save Sapphire.

198
00:16:00,941 --> 00:16:04,033
Hurry, stay away from me and follow!

199
00:16:04,700 --> 00:16:05,700
Hecate?

200
00:16:25,949 --> 00:16:29,585
Now, Prince Franz, wait until I give the signal just like I told you. 

201
00:16:29,609 --> 00:16:30,760
Right, got it.

202
00:16:36,020 --> 00:16:38,560
Good grief, where on earth did Hecate go?

203
00:16:38,885 --> 00:16:41,560
Honestly, that girl does nothing but worry her parents.

204
00:16:41,980 --> 00:16:42,980
Papa!

205
00:16:43,120 --> 00:16:45,086
Hecate, what's wrong?

206
00:16:46,020 --> 00:16:47,020
Hecate!

207
00:16:48,180 --> 00:16:50,620
Mama! Mama! Hecate is back!

208
00:16:51,619 --> 00:16:53,880
H-Hecate's... finally...

209
00:16:54,739 --> 00:16:57,800
Hey, Hecate, where on earth have you been?

210
00:16:58,160 --> 00:17:01,920
Now, don't get so worked up. It seems Hecate is very sick.

211
00:17:02,269 --> 00:17:04,565
Sick? No matter how bad it is,

212
00:17:04,589 --> 00:17:07,319
we're doing the surgery to transfer Sapphire's male heart right away!

213
00:17:07,924 --> 00:17:10,619
Mama, in her condition, that's impossible.

214
00:17:10,875 --> 00:17:14,986
Dear, that's why I say you're too soft! Quick, prepare for surgery!

215
00:17:15,713 --> 00:17:17,020
Aparasha!

216
00:17:19,429 --> 00:17:21,666
Now, bring Sapphire here...

217
00:17:22,102 --> 00:17:24,102
Burasha!

218
00:17:26,509 --> 00:17:28,640
Franz! Franz!

219
00:17:29,359 --> 00:17:31,579
Help me, Franz!

220
00:17:31,889 --> 00:17:32,889
That's Sapphire's voice!

221
00:17:32,982 --> 00:17:33,490
Franz!

222
00:17:33,514 --> 00:17:34,820
Hold on, Sapphire!

223
00:17:35,110 --> 00:17:37,353
I can't go out until Hecate calls for me!

224
00:17:42,059 --> 00:17:44,180
Come on, Hecate, what are you waiting for?

225
00:17:44,200 --> 00:17:45,700
Lie down here.

226
00:17:47,204 --> 00:17:49,740
The time has finally come for me to become a grand witch.

227
00:17:49,860 --> 00:17:51,320
Hecate, are you alright?

228
00:17:51,920 --> 00:17:52,279
Yes.

229
00:17:52,719 --> 00:17:56,580
Don't worry, once you're reborn as a grand witch, any illness will be cured.

230
00:17:56,819 --> 00:17:57,955
Come, Hecate.

231
00:17:57,980 --> 00:18:01,120
I am reborn! Mama, Papa, let's propose a toast.

232
00:18:01,374 --> 00:18:02,860
Ah, that sounds lovely.

233
00:18:02,964 --> 00:18:06,206
Mata Vamesha!

234
00:18:11,889 --> 00:18:13,720
Mama, Papa, a toast please.

235
00:18:14,538 --> 00:18:17,926
Damari Zubarasha!

236
00:18:19,504 --> 00:18:20,713
It hurts...

237
00:18:21,234 --> 00:18:25,771
Mama, Mama, classy people always make a toast when celebrating.

238
00:18:25,795 --> 00:18:27,482
Classy people? A toast?

239
00:18:27,507 --> 00:18:29,273
Of course! Right, dear?

240
00:18:30,709 --> 00:18:33,024
To celebrate the birth of the great witch Hecate...

241
00:18:33,049 --> 00:18:34,141
cheers!

242
00:18:36,239 --> 00:18:38,206
<i>I'm sorry, Papa, Mama...</i>

243
00:18:42,979 --> 00:18:45,233
My eyes... I can't see...

244
00:18:47,559 --> 00:18:50,306
Prince Franz! Prince Franz!

245
00:18:53,229 --> 00:18:55,180
Franz? Is Franz here?

246
00:18:55,279 --> 00:18:57,540
Hecate, where are you? What are you doing? Hecate!

247
00:18:57,969 --> 00:18:59,282
Franz!

248
00:18:59,819 --> 00:19:01,240
That's Hecate's signal! Alright!

249
00:19:08,119 --> 00:19:09,580
Franz! Hurry!

250
00:19:10,019 --> 00:19:11,465
What on earth is going on?

251
00:19:11,490 --> 00:19:13,600
Is Franz coming to rescue Sapphire?

252
00:19:13,659 --> 00:19:15,160
I have no idea!

253
00:19:15,364 --> 00:19:16,893
Sapphire! Sapphire!

254
00:19:18,009 --> 00:19:20,400
Franz, quick, escape with Sapphire!

255
00:19:20,729 --> 00:19:23,000
Hecate, you saved us!

256
00:19:24,120 --> 00:19:24,971
Hecate!

257
00:19:24,995 --> 00:19:27,120
You betrayed your own mother?!

258
00:19:27,399 --> 00:19:30,780
Not just Mama. I've betrayed the Great Demon of Hell, too.

259
00:19:32,020 --> 00:19:32,693
What?

260
00:19:32,859 --> 00:19:34,660
Is that why I'm done for?

261
00:19:35,639 --> 00:19:39,360
Hecate! Run away with me! I don't want you to die!

262
00:19:39,779 --> 00:19:43,319
Hecate is dying? Hecate?! That's impossible!

263
00:19:44,149 --> 00:19:45,600
Sapphire! Come on, hurry!

264
00:19:47,229 --> 00:19:47,925
Hold it!

265
00:19:48,549 --> 00:19:49,739
You won't get away!

266
00:19:57,040 --> 00:19:58,620
Which one, which one? I wanna know!

267
00:20:01,073 --> 00:20:03,360
It's hot! Hot! Hot! Hot! Hot!

268
00:20:04,169 --> 00:20:06,100
Now, pass through the fire!

269
00:20:16,868 --> 00:20:18,140
Get out of my way!!

270
00:20:22,774 --> 00:20:24,900
- Hecate!
- Hecate!

271
00:20:24,940 --> 00:20:26,313
Hecate!

272
00:20:39,046 --> 00:20:40,439
Hecate! Hold on!

273
00:21:06,809 --> 00:21:08,355
Dear God, please help her.

274
00:21:08,380 --> 00:21:10,540
Hecate may be a witch's child, but please save her!

275
00:21:11,404 --> 00:21:14,448
Even if she's a demon's child, she has a heart purer than any human.

276
00:21:14,472 --> 00:21:15,680
Please save her!

277
00:21:31,360 --> 00:21:32,626
Hecate!

278
00:21:33,769 --> 00:21:36,239
God saved your life!

279
00:21:36,610 --> 00:21:39,520
God? So we're inside the chapel...

280
00:21:39,889 --> 00:21:43,913
I'm a child of a demon. If I enter a chapel, I'll die.

281
00:21:44,339 --> 00:21:48,060
Hecate, you got better in here. Far from dying...

282
00:21:48,269 --> 00:21:50,053
...you came back to life right inside the chapel!

283
00:21:50,859 --> 00:21:53,421
Hecate, you may be a devil's child,

284
00:21:53,445 --> 00:21:55,900
but God protected you because your heart is pure.

285
00:21:55,980 --> 00:21:59,320
That's right, He saved you from the Great Demon King of Hell.

286
00:21:59,524 --> 00:22:03,760
It's strange for a devil's child to enter a chapel and be saved by God.

287
00:22:03,864 --> 00:22:06,400
Hecate, you're an angel to us.

288
00:22:06,564 --> 00:22:08,320
Hey Hecate!

289
00:22:08,800 --> 00:22:10,500
That's Papa and Mama's voices!

290
00:22:11,429 --> 00:22:13,720
Hecate!

291
00:22:16,169 --> 00:22:18,120
Hey Hecate!

292
00:22:18,219 --> 00:22:20,800
Please come home!

293
00:22:21,340 --> 00:22:25,460
Our eyes are healed now, so you don't need to worry!

294
00:22:27,909 --> 00:22:32,546
Papa apologized to the Great Demon King of Hell, so everything's okay now!

295
00:22:32,889 --> 00:22:37,100
Mama won't nag you anymore, so please, I'm begging you, come home!

296
00:22:37,299 --> 00:22:39,980
Hey Hecate!

297
00:22:42,149 --> 00:22:43,940
Mama and papa are worried.

298
00:22:43,965 --> 00:22:45,449
 Are you going back Hecate?

299
00:22:45,474 --> 00:22:46,766
Hecate, thank you so much!

300
00:22:47,186 --> 00:22:48,919
Zubarasha!

301
00:22:54,249 --> 00:22:55,826
Goodbye!

302
00:22:57,019 --> 00:22:59,280
Goodbye!

303
00:23:03,489 --> 00:23:05,340
Sapphire! Franz!

304
00:23:07,343 --> 00:23:09,343

